WEBVTT

01:06.725 --> 01:08.525
Hello.

01:08.525 --> 01:09.829
I'm Park Ah Jeong.

01:09.829 --> 01:13.035
I worked as Vice Chairman
Jeon Jae Yeol's secretary.

01:15.035 --> 01:17.155
Secretary? What is all this?

01:17.155 --> 01:19.784
What the hell is this?

01:19.784 --> 01:21.169
What kind of show are you putting on now?

01:21.169 --> 01:22.626
A show? Come on.

01:22.626 --> 01:26.154
She's an employee who made a brave decision
for the future of Haemu.

01:26.154 --> 01:30.073
What kind of shareholders' meeting
is run this sloppily?

01:30.073 --> 01:32.190
Are we just giving the floor to anyone now?

01:32.190 --> 01:36.037
I'm here to protect
the shareholders' right to know.

01:36.037 --> 01:40.902
For now, anyone who isn't a shareholder
doesn't have the right to speak...

01:47.804 --> 01:52.028
According to the documents I have here,

01:52.028 --> 01:55.398
while Vice Chairman Jeon Jae Yeol
was CEO of Haemu Pharma,

01:55.398 --> 01:58.575
he illegally funneled tens of billions of won
to J Care Foundation,

01:58.575 --> 02:00.156
which he himself established.

02:00.156 --> 02:03.034
But no investigation was conducted.

02:03.034 --> 02:05.106
It couldn't be conducted.

02:05.106 --> 02:08.324
Because the person responsible
for auditing this matter,

02:08.324 --> 02:10.602
Head of Audit Joo In Ah,

02:10.602 --> 02:13.013
covered it up.

02:18.608 --> 02:21.763
Head Joo, do you admit it?

02:37.816 --> 02:42.044
It is true that Haemu Pharma
has provided support to J Care Foundation.

02:42.662 --> 02:44.406
However, we determined that

02:44.406 --> 02:46.703
there were no legal procedural issues
in the process.

02:46.703 --> 02:51.809
So if you decide there's no issue,
you just don't have to audit it?

02:51.809 --> 02:54.207
An audit is about risk management.

02:54.207 --> 02:56.757
I determined that the risk of
conducting the audit

02:56.757 --> 03:00.340
was greater than the risk of not conducting it.

03:02.463 --> 03:06.551
There are political and factional conflicts
within Haemu over the succession.

03:06.551 --> 03:08.449
Had we proceeded with the audit,

03:08.449 --> 03:11.102
the process could've been weaponized
in the internal power struggle

03:11.102 --> 03:13.437
and thrown Haemu into even greater chaos.

03:13.437 --> 03:15.894
And why do you...

03:15.894 --> 03:18.605
get to make that call on your own?

03:18.605 --> 03:21.112
Making those calls is my job.

03:21.112 --> 03:24.240
How can we trust Head Joo's judgment?

03:24.240 --> 03:26.915
Vice Chairman Jeon Jae Yeol and Head Joo In Ah

03:26.915 --> 03:29.420
were romantically involved.

03:29.420 --> 03:33.897
Was your judgment truly made
solely for the company?

03:33.897 --> 03:38.339
Or was it a choice made
for Vice Chairman Jeon Jae Yeol?

03:41.424 --> 03:44.714
Good grief, what on earth is all this?

03:46.077 --> 03:48.667
What the hell were you people doing?

03:48.667 --> 03:52.013
How did you let the company
fall apart like this?

03:52.970 --> 03:54.479
- Oh my...
- Father.

03:54.479 --> 03:56.671
Father, are you okay?

03:56.671 --> 03:57.815
Father...

03:57.815 --> 03:59.692
At today's Haemu Group shareholders' meeting,

03:59.692 --> 04:03.972
allegations surfaced that the Head of Audit
covered up Vice Chairman's corruption,

04:03.972 --> 04:05.956
sparking major controversy.

04:05.956 --> 04:08.240
Shocked by the allegations,

04:08.240 --> 04:10.453
Chairman Jeon lost consciousness
and collapsed on the spot.

04:10.453 --> 04:12.872
The meeting was immediately suspended,

04:12.872 --> 04:15.145
and Haemu Group convened
an emergency board meeting

04:15.145 --> 04:18.631
to launch an internal investigation
into the full scope of the allegations.

04:18.631 --> 04:21.675
With Chairman Jeon's declining health
already weighing on the group,

04:21.675 --> 04:25.066
the added controversy over management ethics
has dealt Haemu a double blow.

04:25.066 --> 04:29.983
The group's succession battle
has once again been thrown into turmoil.

04:34.245 --> 04:36.678
[Episode 11: Hot Issue]

04:42.235 --> 04:43.266
Man...

04:43.266 --> 04:45.148
With the company in chaos like this,

04:45.148 --> 04:46.879
I can barely get a single bite down.

04:46.879 --> 04:49.146
You finished your whole bowl, sir.

04:49.146 --> 04:50.610
Good grief.

04:50.610 --> 04:54.310
I heard the press room downstairs
has been a war zone since the scandal broke.

04:54.310 --> 04:57.897
Did every reporter in the country show up here?

04:57.897 --> 05:01.674
I think the Vice Chairman's scandal
is putting us back in the spotlight.

05:01.674 --> 05:05.481
Head Joo's personal info
is already all over the internet.

05:05.481 --> 05:06.509
All right...

05:06.509 --> 05:08.803
Let's all watch what we say.

05:08.803 --> 05:12.080
If your wife or boyfriend asks,
just say you don't know. Flat out.

05:12.080 --> 05:13.747
- You never know how word might get out.
- Yeah.

05:13.747 --> 05:16.851
It's true that we don't know anything.

05:16.851 --> 05:20.926
But how much of Secretary Park's exposé
do you think is true?

05:20.926 --> 05:23.839
If someone like Head Joo looked the other way,

05:23.839 --> 05:28.543
doesn't that mean there really is still
something going on with the Vice Chairman?

05:28.543 --> 05:30.886
That's not it.

05:30.886 --> 05:33.813
How would you know that?

05:33.813 --> 05:36.331
Because I know who Head Joo's boyfriend is.

05:36.331 --> 05:37.390
What?

05:37.390 --> 05:39.974
It's not the Vice Chairman.

05:39.974 --> 05:42.400
- Who is it?
- Who is it?

05:43.661 --> 05:46.825
It's someone we know.

05:46.825 --> 05:48.468
- Someone we know?
- Someone we know?

05:48.468 --> 05:50.053
We don't know anyone.

05:50.053 --> 05:52.388
- Who is it? Who?
- Who is it?

05:52.388 --> 05:53.425
Tell us.

05:53.425 --> 05:55.642
Take a good look around.

05:55.642 --> 05:59.290
Hey, how can you just leave like that?
You have to tell us first.

06:14.929 --> 06:17.730
They've been grilling people all day.

06:21.167 --> 06:24.704
[Special Investigation Committee]

06:24.704 --> 06:26.354
At the time you reviewed
the J Care Foundation matter,

06:26.354 --> 06:28.896
what was your relationship
with Vice Chairman Jeon?

06:28.896 --> 06:30.524
We didn't have one.

06:30.524 --> 06:33.196
- I heard you two used to date.
- Not at the time.

06:33.196 --> 06:35.722
If you used to date,
doesn't that mean you weren't exactly nothing?

06:35.722 --> 06:39.702
When you date and break up,
that's as "nothing" as it gets.

06:39.702 --> 06:41.986
You're worse than strangers.

06:41.986 --> 06:44.644
I heard that he still had feelings for you.
And you...

06:44.644 --> 06:45.722
I didn't.

06:45.722 --> 06:49.213
Not even when you reviewed
the J Care Foundation matter?

06:50.313 --> 06:52.050
No.

06:52.050 --> 06:54.283
These show J Care Foundation's
ownership structure,

06:54.283 --> 06:56.631
Haemu Pharma's meeting minutes
and sponsorship approvals,

06:56.631 --> 06:58.779
its decision-making process,

06:58.779 --> 07:01.014
and records of how the funds were used.

07:01.014 --> 07:03.604
Once you review them, it should be clear.

07:03.604 --> 07:06.407
I was not involved as CEO

07:06.407 --> 07:10.154
in the actual operation of J Care Foundation
or in Haemu Pharma's decision-making.

07:10.154 --> 07:14.271
The funds were also used
for their designated purpose.

07:14.271 --> 07:17.055
So if there was no issue
with the foundation sponsorship process,

07:17.055 --> 07:20.392
then Head Joo's decision
not to conduct an audit

07:20.392 --> 07:22.168
wasn't an issue either.

07:22.168 --> 07:26.369
Whether there's really a problem or not
is for the courts to decide.

07:26.369 --> 07:28.234
But it's clearly debatable at the very least,

07:28.234 --> 07:32.587
so we need to question
why no audit was conducted.

07:32.587 --> 07:34.125
Don't you agree?

07:49.529 --> 07:53.094
This may turn into a more complicated fight
than we expected.

07:54.429 --> 07:56.013
What about Joo In Ah?

07:56.013 --> 07:59.577
She's maintaining that it was
an official business judgment.

08:00.606 --> 08:04.339
She's still holding out
after things have gone this far?

08:05.046 --> 08:06.650
Whether Jae Yeol is guilty or not,

08:06.650 --> 08:09.192
once the scandal with Head Joo
takes center stage, this fight is over.

08:09.192 --> 08:11.221
Break Joo In Ah, whatever it takes.

08:11.221 --> 08:13.208
- Yes, sir.
- Yes.

08:23.930 --> 08:25.875
This is Haesin Daily.
Are you available for comment?

08:25.875 --> 08:28.888
This is XTM. We're reaching out
to request an interview.

08:28.888 --> 08:31.756
The Vice Chairman's mistress
will pay for what she's done.

08:31.756 --> 08:33.466
Disgusting.

08:33.466 --> 08:35.573
Hello, ma'am.

08:38.262 --> 08:40.369
You really are beautiful.

08:42.303 --> 08:45.241
I'm Park Dae Geun from Daily Hanseong.

08:45.241 --> 08:48.051
I have nothing to say. I'm sorry.

08:48.051 --> 08:51.282
Are you from Mipo? Your hometown?

08:52.439 --> 08:55.396
I heard you were pretty famous there, too.

08:55.396 --> 08:57.633
A smart, pretty student

08:57.633 --> 09:00.887
with a complicated family situation.

09:08.160 --> 09:10.204
Daily Hanseong.

09:10.204 --> 09:14.904
You're from a clickbait rag
that steals from social media.

09:14.904 --> 09:17.670
So I guess you don't have
much reporting experience.

09:17.670 --> 09:20.627
This area is restricted
to authorized reporters.

09:20.627 --> 09:22.151
Security!

09:22.151 --> 09:24.216
There's an outsider here.

09:27.664 --> 09:28.835
You need to leave.

09:28.835 --> 09:30.927
Oh, I'm sorry.

09:50.488 --> 09:52.201
Get in. Hurry.

10:04.135 --> 10:06.852
Didn't that feel like
we were shooting an action movie?

10:06.852 --> 10:08.549
It wasn't action. It was romance.

10:08.549 --> 10:10.516
I made my grand entrance.

10:10.516 --> 10:12.818
Fine, let's call it action romance.

10:15.016 --> 10:16.520
How are you feeling?

10:16.520 --> 10:18.280
Questioning must've been rough.

10:18.280 --> 10:20.053
That was nothing.

10:20.053 --> 10:22.555
I've got the core strength
from my modeling days.

10:22.555 --> 10:24.230
I'm not tired at all.

10:33.476 --> 10:35.691
You said you weren't tired at all.

10:44.982 --> 10:47.309
I must've dozed off.

10:49.309 --> 10:52.034
I didn't snore, did I?

10:52.034 --> 10:53.784
You did.

10:57.479 --> 10:59.337
For real?

10:59.337 --> 11:00.780
I snored?

11:00.780 --> 11:03.433
Come on. You're lying, huh?

11:04.790 --> 11:06.500
Wait, seriously?

11:06.500 --> 11:07.927
I really snored?

11:07.927 --> 11:10.211
For real? Really? No way.

11:10.211 --> 11:12.877
Did I snore? Did I?

11:12.877 --> 11:14.421
No, no.

11:14.421 --> 11:17.060
You didn't snore. Just kidding.

11:18.424 --> 11:21.247
But you were completely out.

11:21.247 --> 11:25.779
So as soon as you get home,
wash up and go straight to bed.

11:26.727 --> 11:28.864
You're such a nag.

11:28.864 --> 11:30.654
Okay.

11:32.956 --> 11:34.841
Drop me off over there.

11:42.931 --> 11:44.321
Thanks.

11:44.321 --> 11:45.965
Don't get out. Just go.

11:45.965 --> 11:47.651
You go in first.

11:47.651 --> 11:50.308
You're the one who drove me home.
I want to watch you leave first.

11:50.308 --> 11:52.815
I'll watch you go in.

11:52.815 --> 11:55.011
But I want to watch, too.

11:55.626 --> 11:57.024
Then this should work.

11:57.024 --> 11:58.065
Like this.

11:58.065 --> 12:00.938
Bye. Drive safe.

12:00.938 --> 12:02.759
Look how well I'm walking.

12:08.323 --> 12:10.720
There are reporters
outside your place right now.

12:46.735 --> 12:48.525
It's freezing.

13:12.763 --> 13:15.147
I'll send you a photo now.

13:15.147 --> 13:17.314
Look into this person for me.

13:18.217 --> 13:20.853
If you're done washing up, come out and eat.

13:20.853 --> 13:22.267
Okay.

13:27.179 --> 13:30.638
It's a little big,
but I think it fits pretty well.

13:30.638 --> 13:32.103
It's not big at all.

13:32.103 --> 13:33.462
You look beautiful.

13:36.726 --> 13:40.105
What is all this? This is a whole feast.

13:40.105 --> 13:42.286
My sisters came by over the weekend.

13:42.286 --> 13:43.611
They made kimchi,

13:43.611 --> 13:45.986
so I asked them to bring just a little
for me to share with you.

13:45.986 --> 13:48.848
But they basically sent over
an entire extra fridge.

13:48.848 --> 13:52.393
Wait, do people usually make
seasoned cockles when they make kimchi?

13:52.393 --> 13:53.477
No.

13:53.477 --> 13:55.397
This is just because I like them.

13:55.397 --> 13:58.106
Cockles are a pain to prep,
so I told my mom not to.

13:58.106 --> 14:00.085
But she made them anyway.

14:00.085 --> 14:01.836
She could've just made a little bit...

14:01.836 --> 14:04.937
She always makes way too much.
I can't even finish it all.

14:06.043 --> 14:07.673
Noh Ki Jun.

14:07.673 --> 14:10.971
You're seriously loved at home, aren't you?

14:10.971 --> 14:12.388
Only in moderation.

14:12.388 --> 14:15.429
When there's too much of it, no, thank you.

14:16.759 --> 14:18.648
Spoken like someone spoiled rotten.

14:21.093 --> 14:23.623
Thank you for the food.

14:23.623 --> 14:25.390
So what are your sisters like?

14:25.390 --> 14:27.960
Tell me about them. I want to know.

14:30.003 --> 14:32.358
My sisters are...

14:34.103 --> 14:36.053
just my sisters.

14:36.053 --> 14:38.054
There's not much to say.

14:40.319 --> 14:42.669
My nieces and nephews are really cute, though.

14:42.669 --> 14:44.265
Let me see.

14:45.629 --> 14:47.048
Look.

14:47.689 --> 14:49.999
They're so cute.

14:56.488 --> 14:58.194
Super cute.

15:19.748 --> 15:22.788
[Haemu's Ongoing Scandal:
The Femme Fatale Head of Audit]

15:33.570 --> 15:35.343
Did you see this?

15:38.878 --> 15:40.687
You're already watching.

15:46.941 --> 15:51.581
Head Joo, who is suspected of having an affair
with Vice Chairman Jeon Jae Yeol.

15:51.581 --> 15:54.365
Does family scandal run in the blood?

15:54.365 --> 15:56.157
It has now drawn attention

15:56.157 --> 15:59.328
that Joo herself was also
born out of wedlock from an affair.

15:59.328 --> 16:02.206
And her history with men,
which shook an entire corporation,

16:02.206 --> 16:04.458
doesn't end there.

16:04.458 --> 16:05.505
According to our investigation...

16:05.505 --> 16:08.502
We have confirmed that
she is also dating Mr. Noh,

16:08.502 --> 16:11.843
a subordinate in the same Audit Office.

16:11.843 --> 16:17.293
What's even more shocking
is that Mr. Noh is the very employee

16:17.293 --> 16:21.253
who handled the audit of Haemu Pharma,
which is now under suspicion.

16:24.940 --> 16:28.364
If we spin this right,
we've got ourselves a case.

16:28.364 --> 16:32.464
Perfect.
I thought this would take longer to set up.

16:48.956 --> 16:50.245
[Haemu's Ongoing Scandal]
Ki Jun.

16:51.236 --> 16:53.374
Is this about you?

16:53.374 --> 16:54.972
What do they mean you're dating her?

16:56.357 --> 16:59.649
What's this about Head Joo
being born out of wedlock?

17:00.404 --> 17:03.110
They really crossed the line.

17:04.316 --> 17:07.532
Mr. Noh, where are you going?

17:17.337 --> 17:20.157
I'm telling you, it's true.

17:20.157 --> 17:22.443
I checked everything.

17:22.443 --> 17:23.938
Are you sure?

17:24.566 --> 17:28.816
The two of them went into
Noh Ki Jun's place at night.

17:28.816 --> 17:30.740
She came out a long time later.

17:30.740 --> 17:31.966
Oh, that's huge.

17:31.966 --> 17:34.407
Then the born-out-of-wedlock thing
is true, too?

17:34.407 --> 17:36.426
A friend of mine is from Mipo.

17:36.426 --> 17:39.616
The mother and daughter
were total outcasts in the neighborhood.

17:40.937 --> 17:44.417
The tragic Head of Audit
who inherited her parents' legacy.

17:44.417 --> 17:45.769
Isn't that a good story?

17:45.769 --> 17:48.164
It's like a movie.

17:50.106 --> 17:52.210
Don't talk about her like you know anything.

17:53.187 --> 17:54.781
Oh wow.

17:55.486 --> 17:58.323
This is Assistant Manager Noh Ki Jun.

17:59.848 --> 18:01.373
Just because you're a reporter,

18:01.373 --> 18:04.038
does that give you the right
to write about someone's personal life

18:04.038 --> 18:05.746
and gossip about it like this?

18:05.746 --> 18:07.456
What's with that look?

18:07.456 --> 18:08.665
You going to hit me?

18:08.665 --> 18:10.964
She's not someone...

18:14.115 --> 18:17.089
a guy like you gets to talk about.

18:22.514 --> 18:24.466
Wow, true love.

18:24.466 --> 18:26.808
She stayed at your place for quite a while.

18:30.854 --> 18:31.943
Did you just hit me?

18:31.943 --> 18:33.377
- Oh, sir...
- You saw that?

18:33.377 --> 18:34.381
- You saw that, right?
- Yeah.

18:34.381 --> 18:36.094
- He hit me first, right?
- Yeah.

18:36.094 --> 18:38.500
You crazy bastard!

18:43.516 --> 18:45.955
So what if you're a reporter?

18:56.978 --> 18:59.088
[Bu Se Yeong, Head of HR]
What is this? Is it true?

19:05.308 --> 19:07.627
You said this before, didn't you?

19:08.235 --> 19:11.346
That I should take a good look
at who's really falling apart.

19:12.575 --> 19:15.845
So what do you think?

19:15.845 --> 19:17.689
The way I see it,

19:17.689 --> 19:19.633
it's not me, it's not you,

19:19.633 --> 19:22.589
and it's not even Jeon Jae Yeol.

19:22.589 --> 19:26.284
The one falling apart the most is Noh Ki Jun.

19:30.186 --> 19:31.543
What are you talking about?

19:31.543 --> 19:35.586
Vice Chairman Jeon Seong Yeol wants Ki Jun
tied to the J Care Foundation case.

19:35.586 --> 19:39.506
As part of the story that
Audit covered it up under Jae Yeol's orders.

19:39.506 --> 19:41.605
Because that's the cleanest angle.

19:43.470 --> 19:45.494
It's kind of funny, isn't it?

19:45.494 --> 19:48.997
How could Ki Jun and Jae Yeol
possibly be accomplices?

19:50.188 --> 19:51.654
Actually...

19:52.502 --> 19:54.774
Maybe they are.

19:54.774 --> 19:58.378
Guilty of loving the same woman to death.

19:58.378 --> 20:00.099
Something like that.

20:03.488 --> 20:05.439
You clearly don't know
what "accomplices" means.

20:05.439 --> 20:10.996
Accomplices are people like you
and Jeon Seong Yeol.

20:10.996 --> 20:13.083
People who twist facts,
blow them out of proportion,

20:13.083 --> 20:15.109
create a narrative,

20:16.062 --> 20:18.641
and turn one person into a scapegoat.

20:19.339 --> 20:22.286
That's what accomplices do.

20:22.286 --> 20:24.669
So you became Jeon Seong Yeol's accomplice,

20:24.669 --> 20:26.513
just to destroy Ki Jun,
the one person who reached out

20:26.513 --> 20:28.600
when you were struggling?

20:29.865 --> 20:31.913
Was this part of your plan, too?

20:33.739 --> 20:36.262
I guess you're the type

20:36.262 --> 20:40.539
who ruins the lives of everyone around you.

20:40.539 --> 20:43.502
Did you know Ki Jun
is at the police station right now?

20:43.502 --> 20:47.084
He got into an assault dispute
with the reporter who wrote your article.

20:53.260 --> 20:54.421
Settle?

20:54.421 --> 20:58.121
I will never settle.

20:58.121 --> 21:01.291
Check the CCTV footage
and every witness statement.

21:01.291 --> 21:04.315
He clearly hit me first,
and I was acting in self-defense.

21:04.315 --> 21:06.055
Yeah, fine.

21:06.055 --> 21:08.079
I won't settle either.

21:08.079 --> 21:11.485
And... I'll also be filing a complaint
against him.

21:11.485 --> 21:12.852
For defamation.

21:12.852 --> 21:16.019
He dragged in personal details
that have nothing to do with this case

21:16.019 --> 21:17.952
and wrote an extremely malicious article.

21:17.952 --> 21:19.763
"Malicious?"

21:19.763 --> 21:21.399
Malicious?

21:21.399 --> 21:25.839
Taking personal details
and weaving them into a case is what we do.

21:25.839 --> 21:27.656
It's all for the public interest...

21:27.656 --> 21:29.177
"Public interest?"

21:30.045 --> 21:32.446
What public interest?

21:33.585 --> 21:35.009
She is not someone

21:35.009 --> 21:38.976
who can be summed up
in a few lines of your article.

21:38.976 --> 21:43.102
How she's lived, what she's endured,

21:43.102 --> 21:47.467
the choices she made,
and how much those choices hurt her...

21:47.467 --> 21:49.853
You erased all of that context...

21:51.106 --> 21:54.056
and turned her wounds into a spectacle.

21:54.056 --> 21:55.611
How is...

21:56.645 --> 22:00.278
How is that public interest?

22:04.283 --> 22:06.127
You must really like her.

22:07.995 --> 22:10.369
Yes. I really do.

22:10.369 --> 22:12.416
Because she's a wonderful person.

22:13.246 --> 22:16.836
No matter how much you mock her
or sneer at her,

22:16.836 --> 22:19.625
you won't leave a scratch on her.

22:20.370 --> 22:23.477
I know exactly who she is.

22:24.342 --> 22:26.938
And I'll protect her until the end.

22:30.648 --> 22:32.610
I won't settle.

22:52.575 --> 22:54.303
Ma'am?

22:57.230 --> 22:58.914
You scared me.

23:00.584 --> 23:02.297
Eat some tofu.

23:07.955 --> 23:09.322
Does it hurt?

23:09.322 --> 23:10.883
Gently, please.

23:13.790 --> 23:16.014
What a baby.

23:16.014 --> 23:19.474
My skin is naturally thin and delicate.

23:19.474 --> 23:21.438
Says the delicate guy

23:21.438 --> 23:23.103
who swung his fists like a thug.

23:23.103 --> 23:24.774
What are you, a high schooler?

23:24.774 --> 23:26.748
Why would you get into a fight?

23:32.007 --> 23:33.744
Good job.

23:33.744 --> 23:35.296
I feel so much better now.

23:35.296 --> 23:38.201
I should've handled him myself.

23:39.532 --> 23:41.470
Man, Reporter Park

23:41.470 --> 23:43.136
almost got himself in real trouble.

23:43.136 --> 23:46.460
I wonder if he even knows
how lucky he is that it was me who hit him.

23:47.944 --> 23:50.433
Take some anti-inflammatory medicine
and get some sleep.

23:50.433 --> 23:52.038
- Okay?
- What?

24:00.226 --> 24:02.298
Are you leaving?

24:02.298 --> 24:04.335
I should. I have my own place, you know.

24:04.335 --> 24:05.730
It's really cold outside.

24:05.730 --> 24:08.012
I drove here. I'll blast the heat on the way.

24:08.012 --> 24:10.149
It's late. You'll be sleepy if you drive.

24:10.149 --> 24:11.571
I'm wide awake.

24:11.571 --> 24:13.596
Don't worry and get some rest.

24:13.596 --> 24:14.679
I'm off.

24:16.329 --> 24:18.294
Wait, I have a tree.

24:20.997 --> 24:24.184
Do you want to decorate a Christmas tree?

24:25.876 --> 24:27.112
A tree?

24:27.112 --> 24:28.876
You have a tree at home?

24:46.726 --> 24:49.113
It's so pretty.

24:55.669 --> 24:57.332
You know...

24:57.332 --> 24:59.369
I've never decorated a Christmas tree before.

24:59.369 --> 25:00.614
Really?

25:00.614 --> 25:02.498
You never had a tree at home?

25:02.498 --> 25:04.143
No.

25:04.143 --> 25:07.438
Sparkly things like that
were never part of my life.

25:11.295 --> 25:14.821
Then let's make one together
every year from now on.

25:16.425 --> 25:18.776
Next year, maybe we'll hang jewels on it.

25:18.776 --> 25:20.683
Gold, silver, everything.

25:20.683 --> 25:23.187
- Gold is expensive these days.
- Come on.

25:23.187 --> 25:26.620
I'm giving you the stars.
You think I can't get you some gold?

25:27.589 --> 25:31.128
True. I do prefer gold over stars.

25:31.730 --> 25:33.282
Of course you do.

25:59.601 --> 26:01.588
Hello, this is Joo In Ah.

26:01.588 --> 26:04.782
Hello. I'm Ki Jun's sister.

26:09.503 --> 26:12.857
Articles keep popping up,
and the comments just won't stop.

26:12.857 --> 26:15.560
But he won't pick up,
no matter how many times I call.

26:16.513 --> 26:19.573
And even if I do get ahold of him,

26:19.573 --> 26:22.795
I doubt he'll tell us anything properly.

26:23.464 --> 26:25.450
I tried to hold back...

26:27.210 --> 26:30.290
but I couldn't just sit around.

26:32.297 --> 26:34.261
So...

26:34.261 --> 26:36.295
What kind of person are you?

26:37.282 --> 26:42.304
- Sorry?
- I mean, you nursed him so devotedly,

26:42.304 --> 26:46.272
so we thought you two
had feelings for each other.

26:47.302 --> 26:49.779
But now they're saying

26:49.779 --> 26:52.208
you had an affair with
some Vice Chairman or whatever he is.

26:54.579 --> 26:57.736
We're not here to attack you.

26:57.736 --> 27:01.934
We just want to know as Ki Jun's family.

27:03.047 --> 27:06.712
Our mom saw the news, and she's worried sick.

27:06.712 --> 27:09.830
And since we don't know anything,
we can't even reassure her.

27:09.830 --> 27:11.169
Ma'am...

27:11.169 --> 27:14.169
What's going to happen to Ki Jun?

27:14.169 --> 27:18.577
I saw online that he punched
that reporter at work.

27:18.577 --> 27:19.747
Is that true?

27:19.747 --> 27:21.354
He grew up

27:21.354 --> 27:25.711
never getting into a single fight
with his friends.

27:25.711 --> 27:28.468
Why would a kid like that...
Oh, my heart is pounding.

27:28.468 --> 27:29.853
Seriously...

27:29.853 --> 27:32.479
Did something happen at work?

27:32.479 --> 27:36.897
Then is he going to be disciplined
or something?

27:38.232 --> 27:40.256
Ma'am,

27:40.256 --> 27:43.043
you're his boss, right?

27:43.043 --> 27:45.660
So is there

27:45.660 --> 27:49.944
any way you can help him?

28:05.221 --> 28:08.467
Please turn in your employee ID
during the investigation.

28:27.951 --> 28:29.765
Hey, Ki Jun.

28:29.765 --> 28:31.182
You heard, right?

28:31.182 --> 28:35.202
I'm going in for questioning.
Just didn't want you worrying.

28:35.202 --> 28:36.428
Okay.

28:37.150 --> 28:39.940
I'm fine, so don't worry.

28:39.940 --> 28:43.174
After this is over,
let's go eat something good.

28:43.174 --> 28:44.711
Okay. Let's do that.

28:44.711 --> 28:46.553
What do you want to eat?

28:48.161 --> 28:49.957
Toast?

28:49.957 --> 28:53.357
Let's go get that toast again.

28:55.146 --> 28:57.162
Toast again?

29:00.526 --> 29:02.162
Ki Jun.

29:03.186 --> 29:04.412
Yeah?

29:05.613 --> 29:08.444
No matter what I say from now on,

29:08.444 --> 29:10.989
it means I love you.

29:13.578 --> 29:15.650
My heart just skipped.

29:15.650 --> 29:17.674
I know.

29:17.674 --> 29:19.424
I love you, too.

29:19.424 --> 29:22.153
So don't let it hurt you.

29:45.122 --> 29:46.613
Head Joo?

29:46.613 --> 29:48.535
Why are you...

29:51.433 --> 29:53.473
What's going on?

29:57.710 --> 29:59.603
What is she doing?

30:06.033 --> 30:08.319
Hello,

30:08.319 --> 30:10.722
I'm Joo In Ah, Head of Audit at Haemu Group.

30:10.722 --> 30:15.309
I'm here to state my position
on the allegations raised against me.

30:17.227 --> 30:19.786
Are you here to comment on yesterday's news?

30:19.786 --> 30:21.941
Is it true you're romantically involved
with your subordinate?

30:21.941 --> 30:25.026
Is it true you covered up
the Vice Chairman's corruption allegations?

30:25.026 --> 30:28.770
The recent allegations of a cover-up are false.

30:28.770 --> 30:31.647
In fact, Mr. Noh is the employee
who once raised concerns

30:31.647 --> 30:33.760
about the matter now under suspicion.

30:33.760 --> 30:36.588
Then why was the audit stopped?

30:40.191 --> 30:42.299
I stopped it.

30:44.876 --> 30:47.174
I used my position.

30:47.174 --> 30:51.228
I instructed that employee
not to proceed with the audit.

30:52.543 --> 30:56.034
He was used by me.

30:56.034 --> 30:57.894
Why did you give that order?

30:57.894 --> 31:01.775
Why did you go so far as to use him
to cover this up?

31:02.953 --> 31:06.056
To protect Vice Chairman Jeon Jae Yeol.

31:08.060 --> 31:12.570
Because of my personal feelings,
I failed in my judgment as Head of Audit.

31:12.570 --> 31:15.702
I will take full responsibility.

31:15.702 --> 31:16.751
I'm sorry.

31:16.751 --> 31:18.904
What do you mean by personal feelings?

31:18.904 --> 31:22.234
Are you admitting to an affair
with the Vice Chairman?

31:35.307 --> 31:37.761
[Three months later]

32:21.923 --> 32:24.067
[Volume Recognition Error]

32:31.836 --> 32:33.536
Hey, look at her.

32:33.536 --> 32:35.408
Her eyes are practically shooting lasers.

32:35.408 --> 32:37.369
She's a human scanner.

32:37.369 --> 32:38.953
She can't hide that Audit background.

32:38.953 --> 32:42.000
Did you see how she caught
that Europe-bound container shipment last week?

32:42.000 --> 32:44.431
I guess competent people stand out
wherever they go.

32:44.431 --> 32:45.949
She is good.

32:45.949 --> 32:48.967
No wonder the Vice Chairman fell for her.

33:01.435 --> 33:04.060
The seventh one today?

33:04.936 --> 33:07.326
It's definitely on the rise.

33:10.984 --> 33:14.604
[Volume Recognition Error: 7]

33:26.932 --> 33:29.809
The person you are calling is unavailable.

33:29.809 --> 33:32.809
Charges will apply after the beep.

33:35.106 --> 33:40.928
[Haemu's Jeon Jae Yeol Cleared
of Breach of Trust Charges]

33:56.195 --> 33:59.025
Who authorized this?

33:59.025 --> 34:01.875
You should've reported the plan
before moving forward.

34:01.875 --> 34:05.105
Given Team 3's role
in handling whistleblower cases,

34:05.105 --> 34:07.285
it's difficult to report
every single plan in advance.

34:07.285 --> 34:08.998
Who said every single one?

34:08.998 --> 34:11.448
It's Sales Department 1.

34:11.448 --> 34:15.675
Don't you know Mr. Cheon there is
a direct junior of Jeon Seong Yeol?

34:15.675 --> 34:17.965
While verifying the credibility of the tip,

34:17.965 --> 34:20.472
I determined that the matter
warranted further investigation...

34:20.472 --> 34:23.207
Who gave you the right to determine that?

34:24.640 --> 34:26.750
- Hey, Team 3 Leader.
- Yes?

34:26.750 --> 34:28.403
Come here.

34:28.403 --> 34:30.327
- Right now?
- Yeah.

34:31.272 --> 34:32.561
Yes, sir.

34:36.718 --> 34:38.902
I never thought

34:38.902 --> 34:42.209
the day would come when I'd miss Head Joo.

34:42.209 --> 34:43.873
Exactly.

34:43.873 --> 34:47.173
At least when she yelled at us, she was right.

34:47.173 --> 34:51.770
Now they're not even hiding it.
Audit is going full politics.

34:51.770 --> 34:53.546
I heard it's the same in other departments.

34:53.546 --> 34:56.807
The whole company belongs
to Jeon Seong Yeol now.

34:56.807 --> 34:59.757
What a mess this company has become.

34:59.757 --> 35:01.344
Good work, Ki Jun.

35:01.344 --> 35:03.434
Since we're all feeling down,
want to grab a drink?

35:03.434 --> 35:05.797
- He isn't here.
- Huh?

35:06.610 --> 35:09.676
He bolted the second it hit six.

35:09.676 --> 35:10.787
Again?

35:10.787 --> 35:13.108
Where is he always rushing off to?

35:13.108 --> 35:14.442
Leave him be.

35:14.442 --> 35:16.921
Why would he want to spend
one more second here?

35:16.921 --> 35:21.268
People are still talking about Head Joo,
online and offline.

35:21.268 --> 35:23.011
It's a miracle he hasn't quit.

35:23.011 --> 35:25.866
Head Joo was really cruel back then.

35:25.866 --> 35:29.597
How could she say that she only used Ki Jun?

35:30.452 --> 35:33.167
I hope Ki Jun gets back on his feet soon.

35:36.212 --> 35:38.091
Should we set him up on a blind date?

35:38.091 --> 35:39.338
- Yeah.
- Good idea.

35:39.338 --> 35:40.742
What do you think?

35:40.742 --> 35:42.971
Do you have any decent friends?

35:42.971 --> 35:44.285
Yeah.

35:46.122 --> 35:48.406
I don't have any friends.

35:48.406 --> 35:50.262
What about your older sister?

35:50.262 --> 35:52.839
Your younger sister's probably too young.

35:52.839 --> 35:55.512
- Please.
- What about you, Hae Young?

36:05.530 --> 36:07.362
I got onto Olympic-daero.

36:07.362 --> 36:10.014
Once I hit the IC, I'll be on the expressway.

36:10.014 --> 36:14.664
I'm already on the Gyeongbu Expressway,
heading toward Seoul.

36:14.664 --> 36:16.752
I'll get off soon, too.

36:16.752 --> 36:18.421
So let's meet at Giheung today.

36:18.421 --> 36:20.717
I'll be at Mannam Plaza in five minutes.

36:20.717 --> 36:22.886
Just give up, okay?

36:24.891 --> 36:27.640
I left really early today, too.

36:28.853 --> 36:31.673
[Mannam Plaza]

36:42.216 --> 36:44.866
Do you always have to come all the way
from that far out?

36:44.866 --> 36:46.868
I said I'd come to you.

36:46.868 --> 36:49.619
Can't you just wait near the center?

36:49.619 --> 36:51.890
Or at least meet me at a rest stop nearby.

36:51.890 --> 36:55.274
But northbound traffic is clearer at that time.

36:55.274 --> 36:56.778
You've been working so hard lately.

36:56.778 --> 36:59.842
I told you not to drive all this way.

37:01.341 --> 37:05.248
Anyway, I lost again today,
so sotteok-sotteok is on me.

37:05.868 --> 37:08.792
Then should we grab some sotteok-sotteok

37:08.792 --> 37:11.618
and go rest over there?

37:14.541 --> 37:15.951
Wait,

37:15.951 --> 37:18.560
why would we eat snacks at a place like that...

37:20.854 --> 37:22.342
Let's go.

37:44.257 --> 37:46.801
I'm seriously about to get mad.

37:46.801 --> 37:50.937
These are all confidential documents.
I can't just spread them out at a rest stop.

37:50.937 --> 37:52.408
Then just say,

37:52.408 --> 37:55.538
"Let's go somewhere and work."

37:55.538 --> 37:57.957
Don't give me that suggestive look and go,

37:58.805 --> 38:00.988
"Should we go over there?"

38:00.988 --> 38:04.308
My eyes are naturally suggestive.

38:06.717 --> 38:09.871
Well, everything always goes
according to your plan.

38:09.871 --> 38:10.908
Look at you.

38:10.908 --> 38:13.841
Like when you lied on camera
and said you used me.

38:13.841 --> 38:15.579
He was used by me.

38:15.579 --> 38:20.337
And when you decided to transfer to Logistics
without saying a word to me.

38:21.961 --> 38:24.758
Joo In Ah, just resign.

38:24.758 --> 38:27.815
Going through the whole process of
being disciplined and

38:27.815 --> 38:30.515
exiled to some dead-end post

38:30.515 --> 38:32.700
will be humiliating and miserable.

38:32.700 --> 38:34.165
No.

38:34.165 --> 38:38.638
I'll take every punishment
and every bit of responsibility.

38:40.232 --> 38:43.560
But I need a favor.

38:44.505 --> 38:46.675
About my new post...

38:46.675 --> 38:48.422
Send me to Logistics.

38:48.422 --> 38:51.145
Joo In Ah always has a plan.

38:51.145 --> 38:52.826
A plan that only she knows.

38:52.826 --> 38:55.240
And I'm just part of that plan.

38:55.923 --> 38:57.949
Why would you say it like that?

38:57.949 --> 38:59.726
A plan?

38:59.726 --> 39:01.123
You're...

39:05.145 --> 39:06.862
a variable.

39:06.862 --> 39:09.342
A completely lucky variable

39:09.342 --> 39:12.553
I never planned for or saw coming.

39:14.097 --> 39:16.138
You sure know how to make it sound nice.

39:32.611 --> 39:33.994
Is that your father?

39:33.994 --> 39:37.078
The machine issue looks like a defective part.

39:37.078 --> 39:39.371
Are you not even going to pick up now?

39:42.541 --> 39:44.062
You know...

39:44.062 --> 39:48.028
I heard last time
he just wanted to have a meal with you.

39:58.523 --> 40:01.113
Can't you hear me?

40:01.113 --> 40:03.020
And why do you...

40:03.020 --> 40:05.546
keep eating only the sausages
and giving me all the rice cakes?

40:05.546 --> 40:09.443
That defeats the whole point
of sotteok-sotteok.

40:09.443 --> 40:10.861
It is good, though.

40:10.861 --> 40:12.442
That's it!

40:12.442 --> 40:14.702
That might be Jeon Seong Yeol's plan.

40:15.542 --> 40:18.705
Pick out only the sausages,
only the best parts,

40:18.705 --> 40:20.976
and throw the rest away.

40:29.007 --> 40:31.571
Let's shut down the five affiliates
with entrenched deficit structures

40:31.571 --> 40:33.444
by the end of this year.

40:34.876 --> 40:36.014
Vice Chairman,

40:36.014 --> 40:39.348
those affiliates employ
a significant number of people.

40:39.348 --> 40:42.830
This withdrawal alone
will put tens of thousands out of work.

40:42.830 --> 40:44.164
Director Goh.

40:44.164 --> 40:48.133
This company is not a soup kitchen.
Are we here to feed deadweight with no results?

40:49.354 --> 40:51.084
And Head Bu.

40:51.084 --> 40:53.367
Why are the layoffs moving so slowly?

40:53.367 --> 40:56.157
There are procedures we have to follow...

40:56.157 --> 40:58.121
If we're just going to follow procedure,

40:58.121 --> 41:00.244
what do I need you for?

41:00.864 --> 41:02.909
Can't we be a little creative?

41:02.909 --> 41:06.795
If we don't follow procedure,
there could be various legal and...

41:06.795 --> 41:08.394
Listen.

41:08.394 --> 41:13.807
I pay you all good money
to handle risks like that.

41:17.130 --> 41:18.447
People.

41:18.447 --> 41:22.527
Tens of thousands of layoffs
are just a rounding error on our books.

41:22.527 --> 41:24.551
Stop playing it safe

41:24.551 --> 41:27.464
and earn your paychecks.

41:27.464 --> 41:28.791
Got it?

41:32.711 --> 41:36.151
Once you both sign,
the divorce agreement will be finalized.

42:05.270 --> 42:07.670
[Husband: Jeon Jae Yeol]
[Wife]

42:19.399 --> 42:21.100
Hyun Young.

42:25.476 --> 42:27.037
Hyun Young.

42:34.350 --> 42:36.741
It's not too late.

42:36.741 --> 42:40.068
You were cleared of the charges, right?

42:40.068 --> 42:42.451
It means you did nothing wrong.

42:43.055 --> 42:47.092
If you divorce me now,
you'll really be left with nothing.

42:47.092 --> 42:50.803
Look at your father.
And the company is Seong Yeol's now.

42:52.624 --> 42:55.381
I'm saying I'll help you.

42:55.381 --> 42:58.445
I'll be your connection.
Why are you doing this?

43:05.017 --> 43:06.578
Joo In Ah?

43:08.071 --> 43:10.336
It's because of that woman, isn't it?

43:11.184 --> 43:13.547
That's not it.

43:13.547 --> 43:15.664
You and I...

43:15.664 --> 43:17.688
we can't make each other happy.

43:17.688 --> 43:20.008
What the hell do you know about my happiness?

43:22.075 --> 43:24.868
I know I can't give it to you.

43:24.868 --> 43:27.554
So I hope you find it.

43:28.408 --> 43:31.031
I'm going to start looking for mine, too.

43:33.243 --> 43:35.078
You bastard.

44:06.017 --> 44:08.794
The line stopped again. Call the repair team!

44:08.794 --> 44:10.818
We're running out of time before shipment.

44:10.818 --> 44:13.962
Again? I can't work like this.

44:13.962 --> 44:16.171
It's getting worse over time.

44:16.171 --> 44:17.565
What was it like before?

44:17.565 --> 44:19.143
It wasn't this bad.

44:19.143 --> 44:22.293
But after the Vice Chairman changed,
the parts supplier changed too.

44:22.293 --> 44:24.150
It's been like this ever since.

44:24.150 --> 44:27.870
Where do those parts come in?

45:47.867 --> 45:49.500
Are you okay?

45:50.693 --> 45:55.038
I'm sure it was right here.

45:55.038 --> 45:56.543
Are you looking for something?

45:56.543 --> 45:58.593
No, I thought I dropped something.

45:58.593 --> 46:00.171
I must've been mistaken.

46:00.171 --> 46:01.560
Thanks.

46:34.997 --> 46:36.976
Yes, this is Moo Gwang Il.

46:36.976 --> 46:39.357
Okay, I'll come up right away.

46:43.351 --> 46:45.724
Yes, this is Cha Seong Tae.

46:45.724 --> 46:48.343
Understood. I'll come up right away.

46:51.116 --> 46:53.157
This is Baek Hyun Gyu from Audit Team 3.

46:53.157 --> 46:54.882
Oh, got it.

47:04.778 --> 47:08.160
[Personnel Record]

47:13.202 --> 47:15.319
How many people is that?

47:16.371 --> 47:18.757
What am I supposed to do with all of them?

47:26.046 --> 47:27.581
Hello, Head Bu.

47:27.581 --> 47:29.749
- Have a seat, sir.
- Yes.

47:57.942 --> 48:00.546
So the company is doing

48:00.546 --> 48:03.866
a major restructuring
and organizational reshuffle.

48:03.866 --> 48:05.890
And in Audit,

48:05.890 --> 48:08.296
they're getting rid of Team 3 entirely.

48:09.180 --> 48:11.051
Then what happens to the three of us?

48:11.051 --> 48:14.897
You three will probably be moved
to other teams.

48:21.613 --> 48:25.014
But Team Leader, Manager Cha, and Hyun Gyu...

48:25.911 --> 48:27.350
probably...

48:29.526 --> 48:32.864
They'll recommend voluntary retirement
and give them a deadline.

48:32.864 --> 48:34.034
If they don't leave by then,

48:34.034 --> 48:36.488
they'll pressure them
by cutting their severance pay.

48:37.096 --> 48:38.324
Yeah.

48:38.916 --> 48:40.372
This is insane.

48:43.294 --> 48:45.473
What are we going to do?

48:48.481 --> 48:49.762
Well...

48:52.814 --> 48:54.965
I knew it. It was a parts issue.

48:54.965 --> 48:58.845
Only the packaging is genuine.
The actual parts inside are old.

48:58.845 --> 49:01.629
No wonder the new machines
aren't working properly.

49:01.629 --> 49:04.135
Of course that would disrupt logistics.

49:04.135 --> 49:07.099
And HM Trans, the logistics subsidiary,
would lose value.

49:07.099 --> 49:08.712
They must want to sell it.

49:08.712 --> 49:10.815
And they'll use the sale proceeds
to secure more shares.

49:10.815 --> 49:13.222
HQ is downsizing, too.

49:13.222 --> 49:15.185
Restructuring has started,

49:16.122 --> 49:18.366
and Audit Team 3 is being dissolved.

49:18.366 --> 49:19.493
What?

49:19.493 --> 49:20.755
Team 3?

49:21.708 --> 49:24.685
Team Leader, Manager Cha, and even Hyun Gyu

49:24.685 --> 49:26.897
have already been urged to resign.

49:26.897 --> 49:29.086
So...

49:29.086 --> 49:31.296
I can't come see you today.

49:31.296 --> 49:33.625
I think I need to stay with the team.

49:35.416 --> 49:37.171
Yeah, you should.

49:38.136 --> 49:39.953
Or...

49:39.953 --> 49:41.561
do you want to come up?

49:41.561 --> 49:43.170
Everyone would be happy to see you.

49:44.319 --> 49:45.873
Should I?

49:57.927 --> 50:01.882
Jeon Seong Yeol hasn't secured
all the shares yet,

50:01.882 --> 50:04.249
so we should wait and see how this plays out...

50:04.249 --> 50:05.490
Hey.

50:08.247 --> 50:11.930
Don't talk so easily
just because it's not your problem.

50:11.930 --> 50:14.203
What do you mean
we don't know how this will play out?

50:14.203 --> 50:16.375
We've already been notified.

50:16.375 --> 50:17.483
Yeah?

50:21.956 --> 50:23.492
Slow down a little.

50:23.492 --> 50:25.722
You're drinking too fast.

50:25.722 --> 50:27.084
Pyeon Hae Young.

50:27.793 --> 50:29.728
Do I look easy to you?

50:29.728 --> 50:33.521
On a day like this,
you're worried about the tab?

50:34.646 --> 50:36.546
That's not what I meant.

50:39.179 --> 50:41.202
Just give it to me. I'll grill it.

50:41.202 --> 50:42.642
No, it's fine.

50:42.642 --> 50:45.146
- Just give it to me.
- Ms. Yoon.

50:45.146 --> 50:47.914
Grilling meat isn't easy either.

50:47.914 --> 50:51.108
Stop saying things are easy.

50:54.087 --> 50:57.714
I'm such a useless team leader,

50:57.714 --> 51:00.084
I can't even face you all.

51:01.607 --> 51:03.224
If I'd had...

51:03.224 --> 51:06.471
just a little more power,

51:06.471 --> 51:11.024
I could've stopped our entire team

51:11.024 --> 51:14.105
from being wiped out like this.

51:14.105 --> 51:16.458
I'm really sorry.

51:16.458 --> 51:17.779
I'm sorry.

51:19.946 --> 51:22.827
What am I going to do?

51:26.819 --> 51:29.793
Hae Young, thank you for buying us beef.

51:29.793 --> 51:32.733
Eat up. And stop crying.

51:33.432 --> 51:36.874
- Where are you?
- Da Ye, you'll be okay without me, huh?

51:47.754 --> 51:50.218
Accomplices are people like

51:50.218 --> 51:53.436
you and Jeon Seong Yeol.

52:04.866 --> 52:06.765
[Haemu Group Sale Plan]

52:06.765 --> 52:08.249
We're doing the TH deal

52:08.249 --> 52:10.815
with CEO Kang, so book us a private room.

52:10.815 --> 52:12.890
And make sure we have enough partners.

52:16.944 --> 52:19.142
Okay, understood.

52:19.142 --> 52:20.799
What?

52:20.799 --> 52:22.461
What's with that look?

52:23.272 --> 52:26.312
Don't tell me my brother
never asked you to do this.

52:29.667 --> 52:31.799
You know this is all business, right?

52:31.799 --> 52:33.985
Let's handle this professionally.

52:40.235 --> 52:41.890
Oh, yes.

52:41.890 --> 52:43.808
I understand what you mean.

52:43.808 --> 52:45.907
Thank you, yeah.

52:48.457 --> 52:51.199
You said you were nearby,
but you weren't coming.

52:52.164 --> 52:53.887
What call was so serious?

52:53.887 --> 52:56.194
It was Head Bu.

52:56.194 --> 52:59.004
I thought we'd need allies
inside the company, too.

52:59.004 --> 53:01.334
So I sent her everything I've gathered so far.

53:01.334 --> 53:03.521
Gosh, it's freezing.

53:03.521 --> 53:04.821
Oh my.

53:04.821 --> 53:07.341
Let's go inside first and talk later.

53:07.341 --> 53:10.292
But why did you come out dressed so thin?
Aren't you cold?

53:10.292 --> 53:13.338
You look way colder than me.

53:13.338 --> 53:14.898
Look how red your ears are.

53:14.898 --> 53:16.863
Here is the thing...

53:19.205 --> 53:20.894
Head Joo?

53:25.125 --> 53:26.777
Ma'am!

53:30.202 --> 53:31.373
I must be really drunk.

53:31.373 --> 53:33.205
Hey, Ki Jun!

53:33.205 --> 53:34.929
Where were you?

53:34.929 --> 53:37.629
We were looking for you.

53:37.629 --> 53:39.586
Is this your girlfriend?

53:39.586 --> 53:40.615
Hello.

53:40.615 --> 53:43.658
I'm the useless team leader, Team Leader Moo.

53:45.750 --> 53:49.095
She looks exactly like Head Joo In Ah.

53:49.095 --> 53:51.892
Hey, look! She looks just like Head Joo.

53:57.423 --> 53:58.845
Welcome.

54:12.494 --> 54:15.500
So, who confessed first?

54:15.500 --> 54:17.257
- I did.
- I did...

54:17.257 --> 54:19.125
What? You confessed to each other?

54:19.125 --> 54:22.590
K-I-S-S-I-N-G!

54:22.590 --> 54:26.891
So the boyfriend Ms. Yoon mentioned back then

54:26.891 --> 54:29.135
was Mr. Noh?

54:29.135 --> 54:31.290
How would you know who my boyfriend is?

54:31.290 --> 54:34.158
It was obvious just from
the way Mr. Noh looked at you.

54:36.263 --> 54:38.064
The way he looked at her?

54:40.340 --> 54:43.158
Then... Head Joo...

54:43.158 --> 54:46.605
What was that thing you said
during the interview?

54:46.605 --> 54:49.598
That you only used Mr. Noh.

54:50.212 --> 54:51.768
I knew it.

54:51.768 --> 54:56.894
You lied to protect our Ki Jun, didn't you?

54:56.894 --> 54:59.834
- Yeah?
- Nothing gets past you, Ms. Pyeon.

54:59.834 --> 55:01.809
She was totally in love!

55:01.809 --> 55:05.289
You two really look good together.
You're the best...

55:05.289 --> 55:08.009
The most perfect couple.

55:08.715 --> 55:10.082
- Are you crying?
- What's wrong with him?

55:10.082 --> 55:11.348
Why are you crying?

55:11.348 --> 55:12.804
Thank you.

55:12.804 --> 55:15.523
Finally, we have a couple in our Audit Office.

55:15.523 --> 55:19.092
The couple of the century has been born!

55:23.106 --> 55:28.038
Of course... we won't be Audit anymore.

55:31.451 --> 55:33.803
I really shouldn't be this happy

55:34.437 --> 55:37.440
about someone else's love life right now.

55:37.440 --> 55:38.795
I don't know.

55:47.238 --> 55:50.369
The game isn't over yet.

55:50.369 --> 55:51.888
I made you a promise, didn't I?

55:51.888 --> 55:54.226
That I would become your fortress.

55:54.226 --> 55:57.874
I will keep that promise until the very end.

56:00.685 --> 56:03.560
Stay strong. It's not over.

56:03.560 --> 56:06.405
Your fortress is right here, everyone!

56:08.715 --> 56:10.405
Thank you.

56:18.573 --> 56:22.410
We haven't even solved anything yet.
That was a little bold.

56:22.410 --> 56:24.215
I know.

56:24.215 --> 56:27.545
Why do I keep bluffing like this?

56:27.545 --> 56:29.511
But when Team Leader Moo

56:29.511 --> 56:32.788
looks at me like that,
how am I supposed to just sit there?

56:34.557 --> 56:35.961
You did great.

56:35.961 --> 56:37.911
We'll figure it out.

56:37.911 --> 56:39.273
- Right.
- Yeah.

56:39.273 --> 56:40.723
I think we can find a way.

56:40.723 --> 56:44.973
Head Bu said there are directors
who oppose Jeon Seong Yeol's methods.

56:44.973 --> 56:47.884
So if we want to persuade them
to exercise their votes,

56:47.884 --> 56:50.337
we need an alternative to Jeon Seong Yeol.

56:50.337 --> 56:53.674
Someone with the power
and credibility to stand against him.

56:53.674 --> 56:58.399
Someone the directors can trust
enough to cast their votes for.

56:59.551 --> 57:01.532
That leaves only Jeon Jae Yeol.

57:02.931 --> 57:04.049
Exactly.

57:04.049 --> 57:05.547
But...

57:05.547 --> 57:07.750
if we just show up like this,

57:07.750 --> 57:10.180
do you think he will agree to meet us?

57:17.617 --> 57:19.532
Love you.

57:23.404 --> 57:25.117
Love you.

57:37.773 --> 57:39.680
It's a monstera.

57:42.553 --> 57:46.961
They say the holes in its leaves
let the wind pass through,

57:46.961 --> 57:49.610
so the leaves don't tear
and the plant lives longer.

57:50.983 --> 57:52.399
So in a way,

57:54.507 --> 57:56.164
its wounds are

57:56.900 --> 57:59.360
how it survives.

58:35.158 --> 58:38.176
It's 150,000 people.

58:38.176 --> 58:40.502
If every sell-off goes through
as Jeon Seong Yeol planned,

58:40.502 --> 58:42.677
that many people will lose their jobs.

58:43.614 --> 58:46.552
We have to stop the worst-case scenario.

58:46.552 --> 58:48.770
We're not asking you to return to the company.

58:48.770 --> 58:51.863
We're only asking you
to help persuade the directors

58:51.863 --> 58:56.005
so the board can pass the motion
to dismiss Jeon Seong Yeol.

58:58.496 --> 59:00.240
In Ah...

59:00.240 --> 59:02.529
Don't you think
you're being a little cruel to me?

59:06.309 --> 59:09.249
You acted like you were protecting me in public

59:09.249 --> 59:11.615
just to protect your man.

59:11.615 --> 59:15.091
And now you suddenly show up
asking me to save the company?

59:16.377 --> 59:18.507
I'm at peace right now.

59:18.507 --> 59:20.685
My mother is doing much better, too.

59:21.344 --> 59:23.693
Please don't drag me back into this.

59:54.270 --> 59:56.146
Did you call for me?

59:59.884 --> 01:00:01.455
What the hell are you doing?

01:00:01.455 --> 01:00:02.510
What did you pull?

01:00:02.510 --> 01:00:05.534
Did you not understand
when I said to match the partners?

01:00:05.534 --> 01:00:07.438
I did match them.

01:00:07.438 --> 01:00:10.477
One protocol staff member per attendee.

01:00:10.477 --> 01:00:12.817
They're all men!

01:00:14.241 --> 01:00:15.824
You...

01:00:15.824 --> 01:00:18.213
So you do have a mind of your own.

01:00:18.807 --> 01:00:22.284
I don't need someone
who thinks for herself while working for me.

01:00:22.284 --> 01:00:24.528
Just do exactly what I tell you.

01:00:25.620 --> 01:00:26.911
Get out.

01:00:35.311 --> 01:00:36.842
Hello.

01:00:36.842 --> 01:00:39.028
Speed up the sale of HM Trans.

01:00:40.423 --> 01:00:43.418
I don't care. Just set the date!

01:00:50.106 --> 01:00:51.520
My dear.

01:00:52.352 --> 01:00:53.989
Thank you.

01:00:54.952 --> 01:00:56.442
It's hot, so be careful.

01:01:17.031 --> 01:01:19.942
It's 150,000 people.

01:01:19.942 --> 01:01:22.772
If every sell-off goes through
as Jeon Seong Yeol planned,

01:01:22.772 --> 01:01:25.042
that many people will lose their jobs.

01:01:41.472 --> 01:01:42.970
[Haemu Group]

01:01:49.681 --> 01:01:52.407
[Haemu Moves to Sell HM Trans]

01:02:19.289 --> 01:02:22.359
Vice Chairman!
Is this what you call a legitimate sale?

01:02:22.359 --> 01:02:24.229
Unfair dismissal! Withdraw it!

01:02:24.229 --> 01:02:26.476
- Withdraw it!
- Withdraw it!

01:02:26.476 --> 01:02:28.114
A rushed sale! Stop it now!

01:02:28.114 --> 01:02:30.566
- Stop it now!
- Stop it now!

01:02:33.975 --> 01:02:35.496
Everyone.

01:02:36.158 --> 01:02:38.249
What you're doing here is

01:02:38.249 --> 01:02:40.292
obstruction of business.

01:02:40.292 --> 01:02:41.576
Got it?

01:02:43.671 --> 01:02:46.763
Clear them out before the guests arrive.

01:02:48.606 --> 01:02:51.085
Did he say clear us out?

01:03:11.328 --> 01:03:13.259
Head Joo!

01:04:38.132 --> 01:04:39.610
An emergency board meeting?

01:04:39.610 --> 01:04:41.355
Are you trying to remove me as CEO first?

01:04:41.355 --> 01:04:42.414
- Target confirmed.
- There he is!

01:04:42.414 --> 01:04:44.277
I'm following him now.

01:04:44.277 --> 01:04:46.309
This really feels like we're shooting a movie.

01:04:46.309 --> 01:04:48.026
What? Marriage?

01:04:48.026 --> 01:04:49.839
No. I'm not getting married.

01:04:49.839 --> 01:04:51.067
It doubles the risk.

01:04:51.067 --> 01:04:53.297
Not even with me? Why'd you hesitate?

01:04:53.297 --> 01:04:56.097
It feels like those two are starting
to swap personalities.

01:04:56.097 --> 01:04:58.575
They say couples grow alike
when they're in love.

01:04:58.575 --> 01:04:59.699
Are you laughing?

01:04:59.699 --> 01:05:03.005
There might still be something
between those two.

01:05:03.005 --> 01:05:05.864
Ki Jun, I have something to tell you.
